WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:03.930
Click New deal to start creating a deal in
the CRM.

00:00:04.683 --> 00:00:07.883
Choose the contact for the deal from the
list.

00:00:08.616 --> 00:00:11.536
Click Next to proceed to the deal details.

00:00:12.283 --> 00:00:16.723
Enter the deal amount in the Amount (USD)
field.

00:00:17.483 --> 00:00:20.723
Choose a stage from the Stage dropdown.

00:00:21.483 --> 00:00:25.043
Set a date in the Expected close date
field.

00:00:25.783 --> 00:00:29.103
Click Next to review the deal details.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:33.090
Click Create deal to finalize your new
deal.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:38.650
Click Dashboard to return and view your
updated pipeline value.
